    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\ude08 WISHLIST NOW! \ud83d\ude08</h1><p></p><br><h1>\u2661 Games that satan loves \u2661</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/d2fa3e9503fe7f83b8b0476557945380.avif?t=1661626979\" /></div><br><br>Satan's Puzzle 666 is a puzzle game where you have to match the<br>pieces to obtain the seal of evil spirits and behold their<br>divine image<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/f2d9b5c4055751838719cab4cb640d91.poster.avif?t=1661626979\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/f2d9b5c4055751838719cab4cb640d91.webm?t=1661626979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/f2d9b5c4055751838719cab4cb640d91.mp4?t=1661626979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>meet 12 angels who were expelled from heaven alongside lucifer</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relax with the soundtrack that is calm, profane and dark</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with mouse and buttons</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Black, white and hellish design</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fun facts about evil spirits and their abilities</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/37453e6732a4cf047dcf7cb2cfa1e909.poster.avif?t=1661626979\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/37453e6732a4cf047dcf7cb2cfa1e909.webm?t=1661626979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847110/extras/37453e6732a4cf047dcf7cb2cfa1e909.mp4?t=1661626979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
